---
kind: scene
id: isles.shrineNyx
title: Admin Nyx
on: enterPlace
target: place.sunfallShrine
after: 'visited("isles.shrine")'
once: false
when: "!holds('defeated', ['duskAdminNyx'])"
priority: 10
---

// AREA isles: the Dusk Remnant's last stand. Repeatable until Nyx is beaten.

## The inner hall

::bg{location="sunfall-shrine" time="night"}
@duskAdminNyx{code="0010" emotion="angry"}: Vex gave up. I did not. This shrine is the last thing Team Eclipse ever wanted, and I will have it.
::battle{foe="duskAdminNyx" kind="boss" resultKey="fight"}
<match subject="scene.battle.fight.won">
  <when is="true">
    ::assert{defeated(duskAdminNyx)}
    ::set{run.money += 6000}
    @duskAdminNyx{code="0020"}: Then keep your shrine. There is nothing in it but old light.
    @narrator{code="0010"}: Nyx walks out past {{userName}} and does not look back. The Dusk Remnant leaves Sunport on the morning ferry.
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @duskAdminNyx{code="0030" emotion="smug"}: Go and heal. The shrine and I are not going anywhere.
  </otherwise>
</match>
